    "title": "YubiKey",
    "tagline": "YubiKey is a hardware security key made by Yubico that provides strong multi-factor authentication (MFA). It’s a small physical device (USB-A, USB-C, Lightning, or NFC, Biometric) that you plug into your computer or tap on your phone to securely log in.",
    "overviewHtml": "<h1 data-start=\"291\" data-end=\"318\">Why do we need a YubiKey?</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"320\" data-end=\"367\">Passwords alone are <strong data-start=\"340\" data-end=\"363\">weak and vulnerable</strong> to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"368\" data-end=\"476\">\r\n<li data-start=\"368\" data-end=\"388\">\r\n<p data-start=\"370\" data-end=\"388\">Phishing attacks</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"389\" data-end=\"407\">\r\n<p data-start=\"391\" data-end=\"407\">Password reuse</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"408\" data-end=\"431\">\r\n<p data-start=\"410\" data-end=\"431\">Credential stuffing</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"432\" data-end=\"446\">\r\n<p data-start=\"434\" data-end=\"446\">Keylogging</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"447\" data-end=\"476\">\r\n<p data-start=\"449\" data-end=\"476\">Man-in-the-middle attacks</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"478\" data-end=\"665\">YubiKey adds <strong data-start=\"491\" data-end=\"513\">something you have</strong> (the physical key) in addition to <strong data-start=\"548\" data-end=\"570\">something you know</strong> (password or PIN), making account compromise extremely difficult&mdash;even if passwords are stolen.</p>\r\n<hr />\r\n<h1 data-start=\"667\" data-end=\"684\"><strong data-start=\"667\" data-end=\"684\">Key benefits:</strong></h1>\r\n<ul data-start=\"685\" data-end=\"887\">\r\n<li data-start=\"685\" data-end=\"725\">\r\n<p data-start=\"687\" data-end=\"725\">&nbsp;Phishing-resistant authentication</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"726\" data-end=\"762\">\r\n<p data-start=\"728\" data-end=\"762\">&nbsp;Strong cryptographic security</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"763\" data-end=\"794\">\r\n<p data-start=\"765\" data-end=\"794\">&nbsp;Fast login (tap or touch)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"795\" data-end=\"839\">\r\n<p data-start=\"797\" data-end=\"839\">&nbsp;Works offline (no OTP SMS dependency)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"840\" data-end=\"887\">\r\n<p data-start=\"842\" data-end=\"887\">&nbsp;Zero shared secrets in modern protocols</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.ivaluetv.com/public/702025-12-19-03Screenshot 2025-12-19 110212.png\" alt=\"\" /></p>\r\n<hr />\r\n<h1 data-start=\"1810\" data-end=\"1838\">Common YubiKey Use Cases</h1>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1840\" data-end=\"1876\">Identity &amp; Access Management</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1877\" data-end=\"2070\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1877\" data-end=\"1929\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1879\" data-end=\"1929\">MFA for <strong data-start=\"1887\" data-end=\"1929\">Active Directory / Azure AD / Entra ID</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1930\" data-end=\"1986\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1932\" data-end=\"1986\">Secure login to <strong data-start=\"1948\" data-end=\"1956\">VPNs</strong> (Palo Alto, FortiGate, Cisco)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1987\" data-end=\"2025\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1989\" data-end=\"2025\">SSH authentication for Linux servers</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2026\" data-end=\"2070\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2028\" data-end=\"2070\">Admin access protection (privileged users)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2072\" data-end=\"2101\">&nbsp;Cloud &amp; SaaS Security</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2102\" data-end=\"2178\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2102\" data-end=\"2120\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2104\" data-end=\"2120\">Google Workspace</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2121\" data-end=\"2136\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2123\" data-end=\"2136\">Microsoft 365</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2137\" data-end=\"2154\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2139\" data-end=\"2154\">AWS, Azure, GCP</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2155\" data-end=\"2178\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2157\" data-end=\"2178\">Salesforce, Okta, Duo</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2180\" data-end=\"2215\">&nbsp;Developer &amp; IT Use Cases</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2216\" data-end=\"2304\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2216\" data-end=\"2239\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2218\" data-end=\"2239\">GitHub / GitLab login</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2240\" data-end=\"2254\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2242\" data-end=\"2254\">Code signing</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2255\" data-end=\"2272\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2257\" data-end=\"2272\">SSH key storage</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2273\" data-end=\"2304\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2275\" data-end=\"2304\">Passwordless DevOps pipelines</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2306\" data-end=\"2337\">&nbsp;Enterprise &amp; Compliance</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2338\" data-end=\"2476\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2338\" data-end=\"2363\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2340\" data-end=\"2363\">Zero Trust architecture</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2364\" data-end=\"2396\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2366\" data-end=\"2396\">Phishing-resistant MFA mandate</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2397\" data-end=\"2448\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2399\" data-end=\"2448\">Regulatory compliance (ISO 27001, SOC 2, PCI-DSS)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2449\" data-end=\"2476\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2451\" data-end=\"2476\">Secure workstation logins</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2478\" data-end=\"2509\">&nbsp;Email &amp; Data Protection</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2510\" data-end=\"2577\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2510\" data-end=\"2534\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2512\" data-end=\"2534\">Email encryption (PGP)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2535\" data-end=\"2552\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2537\" data-end=\"2552\">Digital signing</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2553\" data-end=\"2577\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2555\" data-end=\"2577\">Secure document access</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2579\" data-end=\"2603\">&nbsp;Remote Workforce</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2604\" data-end=\"2707\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2604\" data-end=\"2641\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2606\" data-end=\"2641\">Secure remote login without SMS OTP</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2642\" data-end=\"2671\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2644\" data-end=\"2671\">Works even without the internet</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2672\" data-end=\"2707\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2674\" data-end=\"2707\">Protects against SIM-swap attacks</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr />\r\n<h1 data-start=\"2965\" data-end=\"3009\">When should an organization use YubiKey?</h1>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3011\" data-end=\"3177\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3011\" data-end=\"3043\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3013\" data-end=\"3043\">Admins &amp; privileged accounts</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3044\" data-end=\"3068\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3046\" data-end=\"3068\">SOC / Security teams</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3069\" data-end=\"3100\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3071\" data-end=\"3100\">Cloud infrastructure access</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3101\" data-end=\"3133\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3103\" data-end=\"3133\">Financial &amp; critical systems</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3134\" data-end=\"3177\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3136\" data-end=\"3177\">Organizations implementing <strong data-start=\"3163\" data-end=\"3177\">Zero Trust</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr />\r\n<h1>High-level overview of the different product features</h1>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.ivaluetv.com/public/702025-12-19-03Screenshot 2025-12-19 110845.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"630\" height=\"339\" /></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.ivaluetv.com/public/702025-12-19-03Screenshot 2025-12-19 111041.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"674\" height=\"361\" /></p>\r\n<hr />\r\n<h1>Yubico's flagship products consist of three YubiKey series</h1>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.ivaluetv.com/public/702025-12-19-03Screenshot 2025-12-19 110820.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"621\" height=\"246\" /></p>\r\n<hr />\r\n<p data-start=\"478\" data-end=\"665\">&nbsp;</p>",
