    "title": "Tenable One",
    "tagline": "Tenable one is a comprehensive vulnerability management platform that helps organizations identify and remediate security risks across their entire infrastructure. It provides visibility into vulnerabilities across cloud environments, remote networks, and traditional on-premises systems—enabling organizations to reduce their attack surface and strengthen overall security posture.",
    "overviewHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"161\" data-end=\"356\"><strong data-start=\"161\" data-end=\"175\">Tenable one</strong>&nbsp;is a powerful, cloud-based <strong data-start=\"203\" data-end=\"240\">vulnerability management platform</strong> that empowers organizations to continuously assess and manage cybersecurity risks across their entire IT ecosystem.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"418\" data-end=\"524\">Tenable one is designed to scan and monitor vulnerabilities across a wide range of environments, including:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"526\" data-end=\"875\">\r\n<li data-start=\"526\" data-end=\"645\">\r\n<p data-start=\"528\" data-end=\"645\"><strong data-start=\"531\" data-end=\"555\">Cloud Infrastructure</strong> &ndash; Identify misconfigurations and vulnerabilities in AWS, Azure, Google Cloud, and more.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"646\" data-end=\"753\">\r\n<p data-start=\"648\" data-end=\"753\"><strong data-start=\"651\" data-end=\"674\">On-Premises Systems</strong> &ndash; Secure traditional IT environments such as data centers and local servers.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"754\" data-end=\"875\">\r\n<p data-start=\"756\" data-end=\"875\"><strong data-start=\"759\" data-end=\"778\">Remote Networks</strong> &ndash; Gain visibility into vulnerabilities across distributed and remote workforce infrastructure.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"877\" data-end=\"880\" />\r\n<h2 data-start=\"882\" data-end=\"905\"><strong data-start=\"889\" data-end=\"905\">Purpose</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"907\" data-end=\"963\">The primary goal of Tenable one is to help organizations:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"965\" data-end=\"1193\">\r\n<li data-start=\"965\" data-end=\"1026\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"967\" data-end=\"1026\"><strong data-start=\"967\" data-end=\"979\">Identify</strong> vulnerabilities before they can be exploited</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"1027\" data-end=\"1095\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1029\" data-end=\"1095\"><strong data-start=\"1029\" data-end=\"1043\">Prioritize</strong> risks based on threat context and business impact</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"1096\" data-end=\"1151\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1098\" data-end=\"1151\"><strong data-start=\"1098\" data-end=\"1111\">Remediate</strong> security gaps quickly and effectively</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1152\" data-end=\"1193\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"1154\" data-end=\"1193\"><strong data-start=\"1154\" data-end=\"1164\">Reduce</strong> the overall attack surface</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1195\" data-end=\"1325\">By offering real-time visibility into your vulnerabilities, Tenable.io strengthens your ability to stay ahead of evolving threats.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1327\" data-end=\"1330\" />\r\n<h2 data-start=\"1332\" data-end=\"1364\"><strong data-start=\"1338\" data-end=\"1364\">Why Tenable one Matters ?</strong></h2>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"1366\" data-end=\"1525\">In today&rsquo;s complex IT landscape, with hybrid infrastructures and increasing remote access needs, having a centralized platform like Tenable one is critical for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1527\" data-end=\"1651\">\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"1527\" data-end=\"1556\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1529\" data-end=\"1556\">Proactive risk management</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"1557\" data-end=\"1597\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1559\" data-end=\"1597\">Compliance with industry regulations</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1598\" data-end=\"1651\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"1600\" data-end=\"1651\">Improved operational efficiency in security teams</p>\r\n<img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://cdn.ivaluetv.com/public/302025-09-09-31tenableone.drawio.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"722\" height=\"407\" /></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
    "supportHtml": "<p>Name - BHUVAN M</p>\r\n<p>Email - bhuvan.m@ivalue.co.in</p>",
    "howToAccess": "302025-09-27-53How To access TenableOne.pdf",
