    "title": "ID Plus",
    "tagline": "ID Plus is a unified identity and access-management (IAM) platform that delivers authentication, access control, single sign-on (SSO), and directory services across cloud, hybrid, and on-premises environments.",
    "overviewHtml": "<h2>What is RSA ID Plus?</h2>\r\n<p>It is designed to manage authentication, access, identity lifecycle, and security for users - whether in the cloud, on-premises (local servers), or in a hybrid environment. It&rsquo;s built to support modern security needs: multi-factor authentication (MFA), risk-based access, passwordless authentication, single sign-on (SSO), adaptive access controls, and more.</p>\r\n<hr />\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size: 21pt;\"><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">Why Choose RSA ID Plus?</span></span></h2>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><strong> Advanced Multi-Factor Authentication (MFA)</strong></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;RSA ID Plus offers robust multi-factor authentication options, including:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Push notifications</li>\r\n<li>Biometrics</li>\r\n<li>OTPs (One-Time Passwords)</li>\r\n<li>FIDO-based authentication</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ol start=\"2\">\r\n<li><strong> Hybrid Cloud Support: </strong>Unlike cloud-only IAM solutions, RSA ID Plus supports cloud, on-prem, and hybrid deployments, making it a great fit whether you're cloud-native or in transition<strong>.</strong></li>\r\n<li><strong> Improved User Experience: </strong>With features like Single Sign-On (SSO) and adaptive authentication, users can securely access multiple apps with fewer login prompts &mdash; reducing friction and boosting productivity<strong>.</strong></li>\r\n<li><strong> Seamless Integration</strong></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Microsoft 365</li>\r\n<li>Salesforce</li>\r\n<li>VPNs and remote access tools</li>\r\n<li>Legacy systems and custom applications</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr />\r\n<p><strong>Key Features:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Multi-Factor Authentication (MFA)</li>\r\n<li>Single Sign-On (SSO)</li>\r\n<li>Adaptive, risk-based access</li>\r\n<li>Hybrid (Cloud + On-Prem) deployment</li>\r\n<li>Integration with existing RSA products (e.g., SecurID, G&amp;L)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr />\r\n<p><strong>Use Cases:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Multi-Factor Authentication (MFA):</strong> RSA ID Plus provides strong authentication for users accessing cloud and on-prem applications.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Single Sign-On (SSO):</strong> It allows users to log in once and access multiple enterprise applications securely.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Risk-Based Authentication</strong>: The system adapts authentication requirements based on user behaviour, device, and location.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Hybrid Deployment</strong>: It supports both cloud and on-prem environments for smooth migration from traditional RSA Authentication Manager.</li>\r\n<li><strong>VPN Security</strong>: RSA ID Plus protects remote access connections with MFA integration for VPNs.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr />\r\n<p><strong>ID Plus Subscription Plans</strong></p>\r\n<p>ID Plus offers three levels of cloud solutions, tailored to fit every identity and access management requirement. All solutions can be flexibly deployed in the cloud, on-premises, or in a hybrid environment&nbsp;with an open, extensible identity platform. The solutions can also be easily adjusted to meet the pace and evolution of your modernisation.</p>\r\n<p><strong>ID Plus E1 </strong></p>\r\n<p>Secures access to cloud-based applications, systems, and users. ID Plus E1 includes:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Multi-factor authentication (MFA)</li>\r\n<li>Access: Attribute and role-based access controls, single sign-on, and web portal</li>\r\n<li>Customer success and support: Online community access, 9x5 support</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>ID Plus E2</strong></p>\r\n<p>Combines best-in-class IT with frictionless user access and identity protection in cloud or hybrid environments. ID Plus E2 includes:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Multi-factor authentication (MFA)</li>\r\n<li>On-premises, hybrid, and cloud protection for applications and endpoints</li>\r\n<li>Access: Attribute, role-based and conditional rule-based, adaptive access controls; customizable web portal and SSO for unlimited applications</li>\r\n<li>Customer success and support: Customer Success Manager* and 24x7 support</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>ID Plus E3</strong></p>\r\n<p>Purpose-built for security-first, highly complex environments that require future-proofed security. ID Plus E3 includes:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Multi-factor authentication (MFA)</li>\r\n<li>Dynamic risk-based authentication</li>\r\n<li>Access: Attribute, role-based and conditional rule-based, adaptive access controls; customizable web portal and SSO for unlimited applications</li>\r\n<li>Advanced risk-engine capabilities and real-time insights</li>\r\n<li>Customer success and support: Customer Success Manager*, 24x7 support</li>\r\n</ul>",
    "supportHtml": "<p><strong>Name: Meghana.G</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Email: meghana.g@ivalue.co.in</strong></p>",
    "howToAccess": "602025-12-05-19test.pdf",
    "comingSoon": false,
    "destinationUrl": "/portal/overview?c=60&contentKey=VJo63BZA2O5YXHyH1764917092xTdxc9nP5EdKGUKf"
